{"seq":3,"slug":"theodore-roosevelt-progressive-reforms","title":"西奥多·罗斯福：进步主义改革","stage":"DONE","category":"theodore-roosevelt","categoryLabel":"西奥多·罗斯福","chapterCount":3,"docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/theodore-roosevelt/theodore-roosevelt-progressive-reforms","rating":{"composite":3.75,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/10_theodore-roosevelt/3_theodore-roosevelt-progressive-reforms","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"西奥多-罗斯福-进步主义改革\">西奥多·罗斯福：进步主义改革</h1><p>本枢纽专注一个问题：<strong>西奥多·罗斯福（1901–1909）如何用联邦政府的权力，约束失控的大企业、保护普通消费者，并把&quot;进步主义&quot;从一股社会思潮转化为持久的国家制度。</strong> 它不讲他的成长、外交或环保，只讲国内经济与社会改革这一条主线，及其卸任后的思想升华与百年史学评价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本枢纽-vs-兄弟枢纽-分工边界\">本枢纽 vs 兄弟枢纽：分工边界</h2><p>&quot;西奥多·罗斯福&quot;主题被拆成六个互不重叠的枢纽，各管一段人生或一个面向。下表帮你判断&quot;我要找的内容在哪一篇&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>枢纽</th>\n<th>管什么</th>\n<th>与本枢纽的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 传记</td>\n<td>一生全景：成长→总统→世界舞台→身后</td>\n<td>提供总览；本枢纽是其&quot;进步主义任期&quot;的深挖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 崛起</td>\n<td>入主白宫之前：童年、西部、纽约改革、莽骑兵</td>\n<td>解释改革者性格的来源；本枢纽从其执政讲起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>3 进步主义改革（本枢纽）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>反托拉斯、劳资调停、铁路与食药规制、新国家主义、史学评价</strong></td>\n<td><strong>国内改革的专论</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 外交</td>\n<td>巴拿马运河、大棒外交、门罗推论、调停日俄</td>\n<td>对外政策；与本枢纽（对内）互补</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 环保</td>\n<td>&quot;公平交易&quot;三翼中的&quot;保育资源&quot;（森林、国家公园、古迹法）</td>\n<td>本枢纽只提&quot;保育&quot;是三翼之一，细节全在枢纽 5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6 遗产</td>\n<td>重塑总统职位、监管型国家、声誉与再评价的系统总结</td>\n<td>本枢纽末篇做扼要评价；枢纽 6 是完整的遗产研究</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>想要&quot;罗斯福做了什么国内改革、为什么、影响如何&quot;，读本枢纽；想要环保细节去枢纽 5，想要总统职位本身的演变去枢纽 6。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"本枢纽的三章结构\">本枢纽的三章结构</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 公平交易与信托爆破</strong>：理念渊源（&quot;管家理论&quot;、好坏托拉斯之分）→ 北方证券案重振《谢尔曼法》→ 1902 年无烟煤大罢工与&quot;公平交易&quot;口号的诞生。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 规制与消费者保护</strong>：《赫本法》赋予州际商业委员会铁路定价权 → 《纯净食品药品法》与《肉类检查法》奠定 FDA 制度起点。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 进步主义愿景与遗产</strong>：&quot;新国家主义&quot;把行政哲学升华为国家理论 → 百年史学对其改革遗产的多元评价。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径-分人群\">推荐学习路径（分人群）</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第一次接触美国进步主义时代</strong>：按 1→2→3 章顺序通读。先从<a href=\"square-deal-and-trust-busting/square-deal-philosophy-and-origins\">&quot;公平交易&quot;总纲篇</a>建立框架，再看两个标志性案例（<a href=\"square-deal-and-trust-busting/northern-securities-and-antitrust-campaign\">北方证券案</a>、<a href=\"square-deal-and-trust-busting/anthracite-coal-strike\">无烟煤罢工</a>），最后用<a href=\"progressive-vision-and-legacy/reform-legacy-and-historiography\">史学评价篇</a>收束。</li>\n<li><strong>关注法律与监管制度</strong>：直奔第二章，按<a href=\"regulation-and-consumer-protection/hepburn-act-and-railroad-regulation\">《赫本法》</a>→<a href=\"regulation-and-consumer-protection/pure-food-and-drug-and-meat-inspection\">食品药品两法</a>顺序读，理解联邦监管型国家如何起步。</li>\n<li><strong>关注政治思想史</strong>：从<a href=\"square-deal-and-trust-busting/square-deal-philosophy-and-origins\">总纲篇的&quot;管家理论&quot;</a>直接跳到<a href=\"progressive-vision-and-legacy/new-nationalism-and-progressive-thought\">新国家主义篇</a>，再读<a href=\"progressive-vision-and-legacy/reform-legacy-and-historiography\">史学评价</a>，串起&quot;从执政哲学到国家理论&quot;的演进。</li>\n<li><strong>做跨人物比较</strong>：读完本枢纽后，把&quot;新国家主义&quot;与<a href=\"../../franklin-roosevelt/franklin-roosevelt-new-deal/crisis-and-first-new-deal/three-rs-and-first-deal-programs\">富兰克林·罗斯福的新政</a>对照，看进步主义纲领如何在三十年后变为现实。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>阅读本枢纽无需法律或经济学专业背景，但若先掌握以下三点会更顺畅：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>镀金时代的基本图景</strong>：托拉斯、铁路垄断、贫富分化——本枢纽总纲篇会简述，已了解者可略读。</li>\n<li><strong>美国宪政常识</strong>：三权分立、总统与国会的关系，有助于理解&quot;管家理论&quot;为何是重大突破。</li>\n<li><strong>罗斯福其人</strong>：若对他完全陌生，建议先花十分钟读<a href=\"../theodore-roosevelt-biography/the-progressive-presidency/accession-and-square-deal\">传记枢纽的进步主义任期概览</a>，再回到本枢纽深挖。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读完本枢纽，你将能回答：罗斯福凭什么被称为&quot;信托爆破手&quot;又为何不完全认同这个称号？联邦政府第一次中立调停劳资冲突是怎么发生的？今天的 FDA 和铁路监管为何要追溯到 1906 年？以及——为什么史学界把他视为&quot;把旧美国带入现代监管型国家&quot;的关键人物。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"square-deal-and-trust-busting","title":"公平交易与反垄断","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/theodore-roosevelt/theodore-roosevelt-progressive-reforms/square-deal-and-trust-busting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"square-deal-philosophy-and-origins","title":"\"公平交易\"的理念渊源与时代背景","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/theodore-roosevelt/theodore-roosevelt-progressive-reforms/square-deal-and-trust-busting/square-deal-philosophy-and-origins"},{"seq":2,"slug":"northern-securities-and-antitrust-campaign","title":"北方证券案与反托拉斯运动","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/theodore-roosevelt/theodore-roosevelt-progressive-reforms/square-deal-and-trust-busting/northern-securities-and-antitrust-campaign"},{"seq":3,"slug":"anthracite-coal-strike","title":"1902年无烟煤大罢工","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/theodore-roosevelt/theodore-roosevelt-progressive-reforms/square-deal-and-trust-busting/anthracite-coal-strike"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"regulation-and-consumer-protection","title":"经济规制与消费者保护","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/theodore-roosevelt/theodore-roosevelt-progressive-reforms/regulation-and-consumer-protection","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hepburn-act-and-railroad-regulation","title":"《赫本法》与铁路运价规制","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/theodore-roosevelt/theodore-roosevelt-progressive-reforms/regulation-and-consumer-protection/hepburn-act-and-railroad-regulation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pure-food-and-drug-and-meat-inspection","title":"《纯净食品药品法》与《肉类检查法》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/theodore-roosevelt/theodore-roosevelt-progressive-reforms/regulation-and-consumer-protection/pure-food-and-drug-and-meat-inspection"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"progressive-vision-and-legacy","title":"进步主义理念与历史遗产","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/theodore-roosevelt/theodore-roosevelt-progressive-reforms/progressive-vision-and-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"new-nationalism-and-progressive-thought","title":"\"新国家主义\"与进步主义思想","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/theodore-roosevelt/theodore-roosevelt-progressive-reforms/progressive-vision-and-legacy/new-nationalism-and-progressive-thought"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reform-legacy-and-historiography","title":"改革遗产与史学评价","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/theodore-roosevelt/theodore-roosevelt-progressive-reforms/progressive-vision-and-legacy/reform-legacy-and-historiography"}]}]}